      "scr_microled": "micro-LED",
      "scr_microled_notes": "Like OLED but inorganic LEDs. Brighter, longer-lived. Expensive (~2025).",
      "scr_oled": "OLED (organic LED)",
      "scr_oled_notes": "Each pixel emits own light. True blacks. Premium phones, TVs.",
