      "sample_return_missions": "Sample-return missions",
      "scatter_plot_of_16_real_stars_showing_": "Scatter plot of 16 real stars showing surface temperature (x-axis, hotter on left) versus absolute magnitude (y-axis, brighter on top). Main sequence stars form a band from upper-left to lower-right. Red giants in upper right, white dwarfs in lower left, supergiants along the top.",
