      "click_any_food_below_to_add_it_to_your": "Click any food below to add it to your plate. Watch the macronutrient totals update from real USDA values. The benefit readout shows which body systems your meal supports — muscle, brain, blood, bones, gut. There is no calorie target. There is no \"right\" plate. Different bodies need different things, and your needs change throughout the day.",
